raditional), Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"854d-ziK_hQFmbNdvF3ZsA","review_id":"coW7ZfEyt4VYVr8D9iWbbQ","date":"2019-10-04T14:26:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9441721439361572,"text_excerpt":"Such a cute place. There's even a little dining nook with a few small tables and GORGEOUS art on the walls. The watermelon lemonade is Soooo good. Tastes like summertime The Cubano is delicious! The mustard and pickles really add the tang that pulls it together. Bread is pressed so it's crispy. It also comes with these homemade chips. Definitely don't skip the chips. So good Corn grits are ok. Not really the level of creaminess that warrants a spot on a menu with such great sandwiches. They're decent though. The white chocolate bread pudding is ok as well. It's decent. Oreo beignets is where the money is. Can't wait to come back to get them. I'll be back to try more of their menu"},{"business_id":"854d-ziK_hQFmbNdvF3ZsA","review_id":"dwOL5C_lHKYXg54m4dOTwQ","date":"2016-08-25T00:04:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9309524297714233,"text_excerpt":"Went there for first time based on Yelp reviews. Very very pleased with the sandwiches (Cubano and Turkey Pesto) my wife and I tried. Super friendly service and owners graciously gave us a sample of the Oreo Beignets! They were INCREDIBLE!! We are definitely going back for more. Delicious iced coffee too. I would say it's a must try!"},{"business_id":"854d-ziK_hQFmbNdvF3ZsA","review_id":"xfv2TDJu7Q28G4sVK8Yrzg","date":"2018-07-30T15:34:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9281551837921143,"text_excerpt":"Yummy! I got the egg and chorizo sandwich, but did get them to serve it on ciabbata. (Can't remember what it came on, maybe French?) It was delicious. The bf got the chicken salad sandwich - it wasn't my favorite, the chicken salad was a bit dry for me, but he liked it. My friend got the fried green tomato sandwich which she enjoyed. We shared an order of Brussel sprouts, which we thought seemed slightly charred but were delicious on the inside. The grits were yummy too. Also, the potato chips are goooooood. They're not the crappy ones most restaurants add with your meal. Love that they serve French Truck coffee. Will def be back."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"854d-ziK_hQFmbNdvF3ZsA","photo_id":"6MXAow_cUEyNg0E1Gu3fwA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/6MXAow_cUEyNg0E1Gu3fwA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9000746607780457},{"business_id":"854d-ziK_hQFmbNdvF3ZsA","photo_id":"WZrNo_6vPqJ_RGsJlqQ_zA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WZrNo_6vPqJ_RGsJlqQ_zA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7806054353713989},{"business_id":"854d-ziK_hQFmbNdvF3ZsA","photo_id":"7mlryAp1dRY7ZNdIVPizfg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/7mlryAp1dRY7ZNdIVPizfg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7102608680725098},{"business_id":"854d-ziK_hQFmbNdvF3ZsA","photo_id":"13Orz52uCOWcCLJZL4OalA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/13Orz52uCOWcCLJZL4OalA